WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.928
Your system is described in network dot json, with nodes, roads and bridges.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.808
Find the road you want to change.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:16.008
Here, change road E seventy-three's assumed speed from sixty to forty kilometres per hour, then save.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:20.688
Run python minus m src check to validate the data and model.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:26.040
Restart the server, then begin a new session to load the changed network.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:27.180
The actual inference wait is shortened here.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:36.264
The new baseline uses your edited data. Network dot json defines system data; the assembly defines model choices.
